sequenceDiagram
    participant Attacker
    participant API
    participant BloomFilter as Bloom Filter
    participant Cache
    participant DB

    Note over Attacker,DB: Cache Penetration & Mitigation
    
    Attacker->>API: GET /item?id=-999 (Invalid ID)
    
    API->>BloomFilter: Check if -999 exists
    
    alt ID Not in Bloom Filter (Mitigation)
        BloomFilter-->>API: False
        API-->>Attacker: 404 Not Found (Rejected early)
    else ID Bypasses Filter / Filter False Positive
        BloomFilter-->>API: True
        API->>Cache: GET -999
        Cache-->>API: Miss
        API->>DB: Query ID -999
        DB-->>API: Null
        
        Note over API,Cache: Null Object Caching Mitigation
        API->>Cache: SET -999 = "NULL" (TTL: 30s)
        API-->>Attacker: 404 Not Found
        
        Attacker->>API: GET /item?id=-999 (Invalid ID)
        API->>BloomFilter: Check if -999 exists
        BloomFilter-->>API: True
        API->>Cache: GET -999
        Cache-->>API: "NULL" (Hit)
        API-->>Attacker: 404 Not Found (DB Protected)
    end
